		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>%lld folders totaling %@ are in the Trash. Empty the Trash to free the space.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld 个文件夹（共 %@）已在废纸篓中。清倒废纸篓以释放空间。</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>%lld folders totaling %@ will be moved to Trash. Sift checks each folder again first. Reinstall dependencies or rebuild to get them back.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld 个文件夹（共 %@）将被移到废纸篓。Sift 会先再次检查每个文件夹。重新安装依赖或重新构建即可恢复。</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
